---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <strong>BUCT One · 北化一站</strong>
      <p class="label">北化学生的开源校园工作台 · GPL-3.0</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a href="/download">下载</a>
      <a href="/changelog">更新日志</a>
      <a href="/about#privacy">隐私</a>
      <a href="/about#roadmap">路线规划</a>
      <a href="/about#faq">FAQ</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/STAR-10086/buct-one" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/STAR-10086/buct-one/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Releases</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="footer-controls">
      <button class="cap-icondot" data-theme-toggle type="button" aria-label="主题"><span><Icon name="moon" /></span></button>
      <button class="cap-chip" data-glass-toggle type="button" aria-label="玻璃效果档位">玻璃：自动</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap footer-note">
    <p class="label">由北化学生开发维护的开源项目，非学校官方应用。本站与 App 同源液态玻璃视觉；折射引擎参考 shuding/liquid-glass（MIT）。</p>
    <p class="label">© 2026 STAR-10086 · 官网代码 MIT · 国内与校园网推荐 Cloudflare R2 直连，海外或备用可用 GitHub Release</p>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  .footer { margin-top: 48px; padding: 32px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--divider); }
  .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; }
  .footer-brand strong { font-size: 16px; }
  .footer-brand p { color: var(--text-variant); margin-top: 4px; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; }
  .footer-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .footer-note { margin-top: 24px; display: grid; gap: 6px; color: var(--text-variant); }
</style>
